00:32:00,960 --> 00:32:23,520
But a lot of it is still really relevant today in terms of trying to figure out business models and panic trying to figure out how to take their really successful business that they had building Mac apps and translate that to the iOS world, which is you're still building Apple software with a lot of the same delightful goals, but the business models are so different.

425
00:32:24,400 --> 00:32:26,720
It's absolutely fascinating documentary.

