00:34:45,680 --> 00:34:46,160
What's happening?

463
00:34:46,400 --> 00:35:16,400
So as time goes on, we've gotten more and more into it that and um yeah that's one of the things i really value about the apple community in general is that we kind of drive the um the value of software like that's that's one of the um it's kind of like an unspoken tenant of the community that we support apps that are that respect privacy and that um that provide value and are willing to like pay for those things.

464
00:35:17,040 --> 00:35:17,120
Yeah.

465
00:35:17,520 --> 00:35:17,600
Yeah.

