00:42:01,120 --> 00:42:37,520
you have to kind of be picked so you make you submit this gigantic proposal and like give research and how you basically did all the research on on the name like how often is it how often is this word used why should it be an emoji and then you become like a finalist and then you're on the list for like a while and then they finally um uh put it out and that that was awesome unfortunately 2020 has been rough so um the updates to capsum have been delayed uh but yeah that's that's still kind of trucking along but even like so the marketing push for it.

