00:42:52,160 --> 00:42:57,520
So the several years of planning came from basically when you first hop on Twitter, no one knows who you are.

613
00:42:57,760 --> 00:42:58,720
No one knows what you're doing.

614
00:42:59,120 --> 00:43:00,160
And it seems odd.

615
00:43:00,560 --> 00:43:01,920
So I asked someone about marketing.

