00:43:15,760 --> 00:43:28,800
So what I'm going to do is I'm actually going to build relationships, not based on just my work, but actually authentic relationships where I talk to folks, engage with folks that has nothing at all to do with serving me, but sometimes helping them, right?

623
00:43:30,640 --> 00:43:31,600
Very often helping them.

